# Source report documents are NOT redistributed: the ITU IDI report is "citable
# academic use" and the pdftotext extracts are CC-BY-ND derivatives. The derived
# factual CSVs (itu_idi_2024.csv, stanford_ai_patents_2025.csv), the extraction
# scripts, and the source URLs (in each derived CSV's *.meta.json) are shipped
# instead — re-download from the cited URL to regenerate. See README "Data sources".
data/raw/itu_idi_2024_report.pdf
data/raw/itu_idi_2024_report.pdf.meta.json
data/raw/itu_idi_2024_report.txt
data/raw/itu_idi_2024_report.txt.meta.json
data/raw/stanford_aiindex_2025_ch1.pdf
data/raw/stanford_aiindex_2025_ch1.pdf.meta.json
data/raw/stanford_aiindex_2025_ch1.txt
data/raw/stanford_aiindex_2025_ch1.txt.meta.json

# Power BI — the .pbip project-folder format is excluded (noisy diffs); the
# assembled .pbix lives in the repo root alongside the data layer + spec + tutorial.
*.pbip

# LaTeX build artifacts (paper/main.tex and paper/main.pdf are kept; the rest
# are regenerated on each `latexmk`/`pdflatex` build).
*.aux
*.bbl
*.blg
*.log
*.out
*.toc
*.lof
*.lot
*.fls
